OL,3,ABBC should not overspend on shows such
OL,4,Aas Suits and Schitt's Creek, MPs say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC should not pay "over the odds"
OL,7,Ffor the rights to overseas hits such as
OL,8,FSuits and Schitt's Creek, an
OL,9,Finfluential group of MPs has said.
OL,11,FIt is one of several issues raised in a
OL,12,Fwide-ranging report about the BBC's
OL,13,Ffunding and future, published by the
OL,14,FHouse of Commons' cross-party culture
OL,15,Fand media committee.
OL,17,FAlthough the BBC produces a lot of its
OL,18,Fown programmes, the corporation buys
OL,19,Fsome international shows for its TV
OL,20,Fchannels and iPlayer streaming
OL,21,Fplatform.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
