OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABBC should not overspend on shows such
OL,4,Aas Suits and Schitt's Creek, MPs say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe MPs' report said the BBC could
OL,7,F"spend more wisely when competing for
OL,8,Fprogramming". Overall, the BBC brings
OL,9,F"immeasurable benefits" to society but
OL,10,Fneeds reform of the TV licence fee to
OL,11,Favoid a fate of "managed decline", they
OL,12,Fsaid.
